      "revision": 1372528048,
      "text": "Artocarpus glaucus is a tropical species of tree in the family Moraceae. It is found in Indonesia, Malaysia and Australia, ranging from Peninsular Malaysia through Sumatra, Borneo, Java, the Lesser Sunda Islands, and the Maluku Islands to the Northern Territory of Australia."
    },
